# Documentation files

New notes go under `docs/`. Do not add loose `.md` files at the repo root. `README.md` stays the setup page only.

| Kind | Path | File name |
|---|---|---|
| Brand assets | `docs/brand/` | `app-icon.png` and other assets. No notes here. |
| System prompts | `docs/prompts/` | `HRMS-<TOPIC>.md` |
| Module notes | `docs/<module>/` | `<TOPIC>.md` |

One topic per file. Name the file for the subject, in uppercase words with hyphens.

```
docs/prompts/HRMS-LIQUID-GLASS-SYSTEM.md
docs/employees/PLACEMENT.md
docs/attendance/DAY-REGISTER.md
```

Module folders, and only these:

`employees` `attendance` `shifts` `leave` `holidays` `payroll` `salary` `advances` `devices` `reports` `bank` `users` `roles` `organization` `auth`

`organization` covers departments, designations, statuses, work calendars, and custom fields. Do not recreate branch, location, financial years, or branding notes.

Do not put a module note in `docs/prompts/` or `docs/brand/`. Do not append a new topic onto an existing file. Create the module folder if it is not there yet.
